  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Add a setting for people want to keep video playback quality low, for performance or save bandwidth.\n\nI think it can be done as mirror quality in the graphics settings, which override mirror components' property, overriding videoplayers' quality settings.",
